@Host = http://localhost:5135

### Process Charge
POST {{Host}}/api/paymentgateway/charges
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust_12345",
  "amount": 99.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Monthly Cloud Subscription"
}

### Get Transaction Status
GET {{Host}}/api/paymentgateway/transactions/txn_sample_001

### Process Refund
POST {{Host}}/api/paymentgateway/refunds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "txn_sample_001",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "reason": "Partial customer refund"
}

### Get Exchange Rates
GET {{Host}}/api/paymentgateway/rates?baseCurrency=USD&symbols=EUR,GBP,VND
